' 狙い: [H]/[H*] のショートハンド表記と複合状態からの復帰
@startuml
state Operation {
  [*] --> Phase1
  Phase1 --> Phase2
  Phase2 --> Phase1
  Phase2 --> Phase3
}
[*] --> Operation
Operation --> [H] : 中断
[H] --> Operation : 再開
Operation --> [H*] : 深い中断
Operation --> [*] : Complete
' (padding line for corpus line-count requirement)
@enduml
